name=Baby Animal Food
id=BabyAnimalFood
description= This modification adds in the game the food recipes for small farm animals that can only eat mother's milk.
description=Sometimes it happens that you find in the world of the game of children of agricultural animal, whose mothers either died of hunger or of thirst.
description=Even if you take such animals to your farm, they will die of hunger over time, since another female of the same species will not feed them.
description=I had five small piglets on the farm. When I found them, their parents died of hunger. I could not let them die, and also did not want to kill them for the sake of meat. And therefore created this modification.
